courses.learning_outcomes:
After taking this course, students are expected to demonstrate the ability to:

1) briefly explain the major historical events related to education, culture and social life of various Deaf communities across the world;
2) illustrate the different views on “Deafhood” and “Deafness” from a cultural versus medical model;
3) discuss the effect of type of society upon the formation of beliefs about and attitudes towards Deaf people; and

4) analyze the shared experiences, customs and values of the different Deaf communities.
